   (lut:make-event "KIND is :DOWN/:MOVE/:UP/:WHEEL/:KEY/:TEXT/:CONTEXT/:GESTURE/:OS-DROP. DROP-DATA carries decoded file-path strings for :OS-DROP and survives worker IPC. X/Y/DELTA real; KEY a keyword or NIL; TEXT string; SHIFT-P/CONTROL-P/ALT-P/SUPER-P boolean. BASE-KEY is the original key before aliases such as :COPY; native input populates it, synthetic events may supply it. TIMESTAMP optionally supplies monotonic seconds for repeated-click inference on :DOWN (0.5-second/5-pixel thresholds on the same view). CLICK-COUNT optionally forces 1/2/3. Both fields survive worker IPC. Synthetic events without either field remain single clicks. Defaults: coordinates/delta 0, text empty, keys/modifiers/timestamp/click-count NIL." "A normalized event." "(lut:make-event :kind :text :text \"Ελληνικά\")")
